   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Pour» + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Pour** + infinitive expresses purpose when the same person does both actions: **Je vais au supermarché pour acheter du pain** (I'm going to the supermarket to buy bread)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Pour» or «parce que»",
     "texto": [
      "**Pour** + infinitive says what something is done for; **parce que** + a conjugated clause explains the reason: **Je travaille pour vivre** / **Je reste parce que je suis fatigué**. You don't say **parce que vivre**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
